        84.99369812011719,
        510.5343017578125,
        143.51361083984375
      ],
      "text": "These plans of the farm illustrate the updated facilities that have been added\nsince 1950, which include accommodation, power generation and other\nadditions to appeal to visitors and holidaymakers.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        188.25205993652344,
        111.98929595947266,
        207.75344848632812
      ],
      "text": "TASK 2\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        220.0520477294922,
        481.8591003417969,
        238.9492950439453
      ],
      "text": "This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7.0 score.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        252.15370178222656,
        517.1884155273438,
        350.3926086425781
      ],
      "text": "In today's world, education is a must to every child and individual across every\ncountry. The duration of summer holidays became a major thing in terms of\npriority in some countries like in middle eastern location. Where as cold\ncountries which experience long winters have concentrated less on summer\nholidays giving only few weeks for summer vacations.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        363.5146789550781,
        518.095458984375,
        501.4736022949219
      ],
      "text": "On the other side, a regular family would like to spend most of the time in\nsummer holidays by travelling to their homeland, meeting their relatives and\nseek long durations for summer, so that children can spend valuable time with\ncousins and relatives making valuable memories. On the other hand, some\nparents who work 365 days would find it difficult to take care of children\nduring summer holidays as they have to work and prefer shorter period of\nholidays.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        514.5936889648438,
        519.7410888671875,
        632.6336059570312
      ],
      "text": "This has become a major problem and is affecting children in a bad way.\nChildhood is to cherish some good valuable memories along with studies.\nLonger summer breaks allow the children to make time to visit family relatives\nand this early relationship helps to maintain a stronger bond for the rest of the\nlife. Once they are out of school, they have to work and make a living for\nthemselves where they won’t find time for their loved ones.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        645.7537231445312,
        521.2921142578125,
        763.9136352539062
      ],
      "text": "Coming to shorter school holidays, they help the children from falling back in\nstudies (or) having interest. With longer duration of holidays children take a lot\nof time to get back their concentration after the school starts. It has both\npositive and negative side to it. Shorter school holidays help the student to\nmaintain concentration, performance but at the same time they won’t form\nspecial bonds which are really important.\n"
    }
  ]
